                <mxCell id="two_layer_admission" value="&lt;b&gt;Two-Layer Admission (independent gates)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Internal: Lead / Judge per task (deterministic, KB-policy-based)&lt;br&gt;2. Supervisor: per full package (LLM-based, cross-task coherence)&lt;br&gt;A Judge-accepted package can still be Supervisor-rejected.&lt;br&gt;Divergence → BLOCKING_FAILURE. Gates must be calibrated together." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff7ed;strokeColor=#ea580c;fontSize=12;spacing=8;fontColor=#7c2d12;" parent="1" vertex="1">
